          "input": "Tab to the selected 4 m radio, then ArrowRight.",
          "expected": "Select 6 m and show all three affected crossings.",
          "observed": "6 m became selected; the list showed the riverside path closes, the ferry stops, and the footbridge closes. The water rose to the 6 m line."
        },
        "edge_observation": "Two ArrowLeft presses selected 2 m. The list showed only the riverside path closes, and the picker said 'Ferry and footbridge'. From those controls, the ferry resumes and the footbridge reopens while the path remains closed. The illustration itself names the three crossings and thresholds but does not literally say whether any is open, closed, running, or stopped.",
