        "strength": "The large cross-section, water line, and selected radio make the chosen level easy to follow.",
        "weakness": "The drawing labels read only '6 m Footbridge', '4 m Ferry', and '2 m Riverside path'; they give no explicit availability wording adjacent to any threshold.",
